            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## ✨ 本次更新

### ⭐️ 新增收藏快捷按钮

- 列表项新增收藏快捷按钮，支持一键标记常用内容。

### 🛠 修复与体验优化

- 修复切换分组时历史记录重复渲染的问题。
- 修复搜索时部分场景下列表闪烁问题

---

## ✨ What's New

### ⭐️ Quick Favorite Button

- Added a quick favorite button to list items for one-tap bookmarking.

### 🛠 Fixes & Improvements

- Fixed duplicate rendering of history items when switching groups.
- Fixed the issue where the list flickers in some scenarios during search.
]]></description>
